A69. These come high in South America. ~ ANDES
A70. When they do this to the atom we will have more energy. ~ SEPARATE

D1. A source of financial support. ~ DAD
D2. A cockney might pull a rabbit from this. ~ ARE
D3. Here is one vote for some one. ~ YEA
D4. A high stepper (plur.). ~ LADDERS
D5. There is nothing small about this. ~ GREAT
D6. "Listen, my children." ~ HEAR
